    intro="The Scaled Agile Framework (SAFe) is a knowledge base published by Scaled Agile, Inc. for running Agile and Lean practices across many teams, from groups of Agile teams called Agile Release Trains up to portfolio strategy and funding. Since 2026 the framework site offers two operating models: Core SAFe, whose Big Picture is still labelled SAFe 6.0, and the newer AI-Native SAFe. This guide explains how SAFe is structured, which configuration fits which organisation, how its cadence works, and where its critics have a point.",
