          H3("Portfolio"),
          "A portfolio contains one or more value streams. **Lean Portfolio Management** connects strategy to execution through value stream budgets with guardrails, a portfolio Kanban for large initiatives called epics, and Lean governance. Roles include Epic Owners, Enterprise Architects and the Value Management Office. Our [Agile portfolio management guide](/project-management/agile/agile-portfolio-management/) works through WSJF prioritisation and Lean budgeting in detail, and [Agile epics](/project-management/agile/agile-epics/) explains how epics are written and split.",
